  "ruleText": "Sep 305.01 License. Applications shall be reviewed as required by Plc 304.06 and Plc 304.08. Decisions on applications for initial license shall be made as required by Plc 304.09.\n\nSource. #12654, eff 10-31-18; ss by #14360, eff 10-26-25, EXPIRES: 10-26-35",
